        <mxCell id="business_commerce_analytics_target" value="Business &amp; Commerce Analytics&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;TARGET / FUTURE — a separate capability from Business Observability, not yet designed or implemented&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Would combine: Business Events (future input only, never the source of truth for financial metrics) • Orders • Products/SKUs • Channels • Pricing history • Source history • Exchange rates • Write/apply outcomes • future cost/margin/revenue facts&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=9;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#78350f;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
