        <mxCell id="v15" value="⚠ CONFIRMED GAP — Ten API v2 feature routers are defined but unmounted: Dry Run, Change Set, Execution, Rule, Safety Policy, Feature Flags, Backup, AI Foundation, Plugin System, Scheduler. These surfaces remain TARGET / PROPOSED, never current implementation. OWNER DECISION: scheduled build phases or remove now?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#78350f;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
