        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v16" value="⚠ CONFIRMED GAP — app/flowhub/audit/logger.py (AuditLogger.log()) raises NotImplementedError, zero references elsewhere in app/. Real audit trail exists separately via create_audit_event + FlowHubLoginAudit/UnifiedAuditEntry (Activity page, real and mounted). Owner: delete the stub, or is B10 still planned?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#78350f;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
