        <mxCell id="v22" value="✓ CONFIRMED — a structured business-event model now exists in code: app/flowhub/business_observability/ (models, service, contracts, route_registry), migration FLOWHUB_032. Superseded finding — was 'NO structured business-event model exists' as of the prior draft." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14532d;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
