        <mxCell id="v24" value="✓ CONFIRMED — Pricing business-event coverage: write_pipeline/service.py _filter_authorized_price_intents emits pricing_apply_blocked when the pricing-authority gate rejects a write. Anomaly detection is a separate, unimplemented TARGET (see Price Anomaly Detection node)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14532d;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
