        <mxCell id="v30" value="✓ CONFIRMED — Business event persistence/history: bo_business_events is immutable (insert-only, ORM-enforced); bo_business_event_lifecycle_transitions is append-only. Retention is indefinite / never purged (Owner decision)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14532d;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
